    </div>
    <div class="section section-2">
    </div>
    <div class="section section-3">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan">Ultra Slim Design</h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white">Lightweight & Portable</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white">
                Super slim at just 0.67 cm thick and 27.5 cm long, the keyboard easily slips into your backpack or laptop sleeve without taking up valuable space. Its lightweight, portable design makes it the perfect companion for daily commuting, business trips, and long journeys, so you can stay productive wherever you go.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-4">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan ar-white ar-left">
                    Fabric-Grain PU Base
                </h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white ar-left">Stylish & Slip-Resistant</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white ar-left">
                The premium fabric-grain PU base provides a secure, non-slip grip for stable typing while adding a refined, modern look. Durable, comfortable, and designed for everyday portability.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-5">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan ar-white ar-left">
                    BT5.0 Wireless Connection
                </h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white ar-left">No Cables, More Freedom</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white ar-left">
                Enjoy a reliable wireless connection with BT5.0. Simply pair the keyboard with your device in seconds without a receiver or cables, giving you a clutter-free workspace and leaving your USB ports available for other devices.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-6">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan ar-white ar-left">
                    Multi-Device Support
                </h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white ar-left">Compatible with Android, iOS & Windows</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white ar-left">
                Designed for broad compatibility, the keyboard pairs effortlessly with iPads, iPhones, Android devices, and Windows laptops. Switch between your favorite devices with ease, making it the perfect companion for both work and everyday use.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-7">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan ar-white">280mAh Battery</h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white">Long-Lasting Power</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white">
                Enjoy up to 30 hours of continuous use on a single full charge. When idle, the keyboard automatically enters sleep mode to conserve power, extending battery life and reducing the need for frequent charging.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-8">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan ar-white">15 Shortcut Keys </h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle ar-white">Work Faster with One-Touch Controls</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text ar-white">
                Enjoy faster control with 15 shortcut keys for volume, media playback, mute, track switching, and more. Complete common tasks instantly and work more efficiently with a smooth, PC-like experience.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-9">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan">Precision Touchpad</h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle">Smooth Multi-Touch Gestures</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text">
                Navigate effortlessly with smooth, precise touchpad gestures. Scroll, switch apps, and control your device with ease for faster navigation, enhanced productivity, and a seamless laptop-like experience.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section section-10">
        <div class="section-content">
            <div class="section-box">
                <h3 class="section-slogan">Enhanced Typing Experience</h3>
                <h4 class="section-subtitle">Power Up Your Productivity</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="section-text">
                Fly through your work with this efficient keyboard! Featuring a classic 6-row, 83-key PC layout, the keyboard delivers fast, quiet, and comfortable typing with short key travel and large keycaps. The spacious touchpad provides smooth navigation for improved efficiency.
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="short ar-left">Short Key Travel</div>
                <div class="quiet ar-left">Responsive & Quiet</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="short ar-left">15.3 x 13.2 mm</div>
                <div class="quiet ar-left">Big Key Caps</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="short ar-left">96 x 51.7 mm</div>
                <div class="quiet ar-left">Spacious Touchpad</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

